            Thank you for choosing Gift Forever! We are committed to providing you with a seamless shopping experience, including prompt delivery of your orders. Please review the following information regarding our delivery policies:
            <br /><br />

            Delivery Options :<br />

            We offer several delivery options to accommodate your needs:<br />
            Standard Delivery: Orders are typically delivered within 7 - 10 business working days to most locations.<br />
            Express Delivery: Need your order in a hurry? Choose our express delivery option for expedited shipping.<br />

