            Thank you for choosing Gift Forever! We are committed to providing you with a seamless shopping experience, including prompt delivery of your orders. Please review the following information regarding our delivery policies:<br />
            <br />


            Shipping Costs :<br />

            Shipping costs vary depending on the delivery option selected and the destination of your order. You can view the shipping costs for your order during the checkout process before completing your purchase.<br /><br />

            Order Processing Time :<br />

            Orders are usually processed and shipped within 7 - 10 business working days of receiving payment. Please note that orders placed on weekends or holidays may be processed on the next business day.<br /><br />

            Tracking Your Order :<br />

            Once your order has been shipped, you will receive a shipping confirmation email containing tracking information. You can use this information to track the status of your delivery online.<br /><br />

            Delivery Times :<br />

            Delivery times may vary depending on your location and the shipping method selected. While we strive to deliver orders promptly, please note that unforeseen circumstances such as weather delays or carrier issues may affect delivery times.<br /><br />

            Delivery Address :<br />

            Please ensure that the delivery address provided during checkout is accurate and complete. We are not responsible for orders delivered to incorrect or incomplete addresses provided by the customer.<br /><br />

            Delivery Acceptance :<br />

            Upon delivery, please inspect your order carefully for any damage or discrepancies. If you notice any issues with your delivery, please contact us immediately to report the problem.<br /><br />

            Contact Us :<br />

            If you have any questions or concerns regarding your delivery, please don't hesitate to contact our customer service team at <a href="mailto:customercare@giftforever.online">customercare@giftforever.online </a>  or you can call on our inbound customer care number : <a href="tel:+44 2039 871 975">+44 2039 871 975</a>. We're here to help!<br />
